  (label "LEDB_SENSE" (at 81.28 53.34 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid 191882e1-86a7-5ebc-9ac8-9e6ea9228cac))
  (text "FROM THE HAND-WRITTEN NETLIST THIS SHEET REPLACES (verbatim; the part notes are on each part's Note field):\n\nAUTHORITATIVE for connectivity. The ASCII drawing in breath-receive-stage.md is a REPRESENTATION of this file.\n\nSCOPE. That drawing spans two boards deliberately - it shows the sensor, its buffer and R1/R1b at the\ninstrument end so the differential pole and the CMRR budget can be derived in one place. THOSE PARTS ARE NOT\nTHIS CIRCUIT'S and are not components here; they arrive as ports. The same is true of the output stage block\nat the bottom, which is module/breath-output-stage.\n\nParts this page DRAWS for context and does not own. The drawing spans two boards on purpose, so R1/R1b and the\nsensor appear in it; they are interfaces/breath-sense-link's rows and must not be counted, netted or ordered\nhere. Declaring them keeps the drawing checkable without pretending they are ours.\n\n[of] qty 2: R2 and R3 are the two instances\n\n[of] qty 2: R4 and R5\n\n[of] qty 2, one per leg\n\n[drawn_as] the drawing spells a subscript with _\n\n[drawn_as] both legs carry the same label and value\n\n[of] qty 2, one per input leg\n\n[U-REF-BUF] ONE OPA2197 PACKAGE. Half A buffers the trimmer wiper into the in-amp's REF. Half B was a spare\nfollower on the star until 2026-10-04; it now drives the breath LED (#32: Q-LEDB, R-LEDB-*, J-LED-BREATH).\n\n[U-BW-SW, SW-BREATH-BW] The breath bandwidth toggle (#32, owner 2026-10-04): the panel toggle sets BW1/BW0 as DC\nlevels and U-BW-SW switches C-DIFF-BW-1K5 and C-DIFF-BW-500 across the pair beside the in-amp. The analog pair\nnever leaves this board." (at 408.94 38.099999999999994 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7b35c4b3-3b68-5da1-865e-b59291a28707))
  (text "PARTS THIS PAGE'S DRAWING SHOWS AND THIS CIRCUIT DOES NOT OWN - netlist.yaml `foreign:`, exported from the FOREIGN lines below.\nEach is counted, netted and ordered by its owner; declaring it keeps the drawing checkable (tools/check-netlist.py).\nFOREIGN R1: owner interfaces/breath-sense-link, row R-SER-BREATH-INST\nFOREIGN R1b: owner interfaces/breath-sense-link, row R-SER-BREATH-INST\nFOREIGN C: owner module/breath-output-stage, row C-OUT-BREATH" (at 40.64 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 679d87de-dcbd-5ae9-a6af-b3d340ee88bd))
