    (property "Note" "THE BREATH LED (owner, 2026-10-04): brightness follows the breath CV at the jack, dark at 0 V and below. The same part as LED-PANEL, in the toggle row on the far side of SW-POWER from it. PANEL-MOUNTED: no footprint on the board - its leads are cut short and soldered to CBL-LED-BREATH, the lead that plugs into J-LED-BREATH, anode to pin 1" (at 289.56 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
    (property "Pins_source" "datasheets/led/DIALIGHT-605-SERIES-PMI-CATALOG-2021-EXCERPT.pdf p.1: 'Anode (Dot)' - the anode lead is the one the dot on the housing's back marks. A stand-in pin map: the LED is on the panel, and its pins are its two leads as the lead reaches them" (at 289.56 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
